'''884-1''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Catnip Challenges]] during the [[Anniversary/14th Year|14th Anniversary]]. It was added in [[Version 16.0 Update|Version 16.0]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 884
|rarity = EX
|name1 = 884-1
|name2 = 884-2
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''884-2''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
It's easy to look at 884-2's stats and abilities and immediately assume it to be entirely outclassed by [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]]. While this is true to a degree, it actually works synergistically with Shigong to create a much thicker line of meatshields, the likes of which hordes of Zombies will find very difficult to penetrate. At only Lv.36 does 884-2's effective HP surpass the base HP of a Lv.20+90 [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] (26,700 HP), and at Lv.50 it ends up with a very respectable 36,450 effective HP. This HP threshold is nothing to sneeze at, as it allows 884-2 to survive a surprising amount of interactions, such as a hit from [[Death Angel Z-Onel]]/[[Daboo of the Dead]], two hits from 350% [[Cadaver Bear]], as well as many smaller attacks from peons like [[Zang Roo]], [[Zir Zeal]], and [[Zory]] to name a few. 884-2's only real weakness is its low base HP, which can sometimes make it an inferior pick to [[Talents|Talented]] [[Li'l Tank Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Eraser Cat]] in certain mixed stages. Regardless, this convicted felon's not that bad when you get to know them.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

